{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find and take object if it's reachable. If not, check properties and do a specific task on platform. list of available nodes: <Action ID = FindObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectPlatform    /> <Action ID = MoveToPlatform    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />",
